 The original response remains available. Evidence maps, multiple suggestions,
 required acknowledgements and executable suggestions retain their normal
 type checks.
+
+### Coupled-run status ownership
+
+`spiral-coder coupled-status --run-dir PATH` is a read-only projection owned by
+`src/coupled_status.rs`. It reads native version-1 `iterations.json` manifests
+and `state/tui-work.json` ledgers without changing persistent state. Durable
+ledger requests are authoritative: wire usage counts every request, while task
+usage counts task-charged requests and applies the native default when omitted.
+An absent interrupted ledger keeps pending usage and aggregate used/remaining
+values unknown (`null`), not zero. The command reports recorded native
+completion only; it does not independently verify or authorize promotion.
